IANA Time Zone Database
  Timezone names, zones per country and legacy aliases, from the IANA Time
  Zone Database (https://www.iana.org/time-zones), which is in the public domain.

Wikidata
  Subdivision ISO 3166-2 ↔ GeoNames mapping, official languages of countries
  and subdivisions, demonyms, calling codes, driving side. From Wikidata
  (https://www.wikidata.org), dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0.

Natural Earth
  Country and first-level subdivision polygons. Made with Natural Earth.
  Free vector and raster map data @ naturalearthdata.com (public domain).

